WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.670
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.710
Check it!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:10.710
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.940
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.810
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.480
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.280
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.560
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.260
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.600
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.100
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.400
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.440
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.970
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.780
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.410
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:11.510
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.020
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:18.520
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.930
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.090
Fly up, angel

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:53.220
This is where the party is?

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:57.590
It's totally gorgeous...
but really tacky!

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:02.170
Even though it's so mega cool?

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:04.430
I don't think I'm up to this!

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:09.710
The limo had me a little uneasy,
but this is just too much...

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:13.740
--So you're not going?
--What're you talking about?!

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:18.520
There's an ultra-fancy Chinese
dinner waiting for me in there!

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:20.780
Of course I'm gonna go!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.490
Is that all you look forward to?!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:29.790
There's no telling what'll happen
if you don't eat when you can!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.060
It's all right, Meg.
I'm sure you'll live long.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:37.200
--You think?
--So enjoy life more.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:41.570
I'm using this body to
its fullest to enjoy life!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:44.310
All you're using is
your mouth and stomach!

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.040
I'll have you know--

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.580
Please come right this way, ladies.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.450
He called me a lady!

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:55.040
Dummy.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:16.400
So that's Laoban's granddaughter,
Sei-<i>sama</i>?

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.710
She truly is beautiful...

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:22.940
She's giving off a radiance
worthy of this momentous day!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.780
So Sei's well-known...!

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.180
Hey, Meg--

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.380
Meg?

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.360
She really is just a mouth and stomach.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.260
It's nice to see you again!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:42.000
You've grown to look more
and more like your mother!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:46.300
If only she were alive,
you wouldn't have suffered so much...

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.940
Mother doesn't matter...

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:52.940
I'm honestly happy to have been
raised by you, Grandfather.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:04:00.050
I feel proud and honored to have
a granddaughter such as you.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:05.150
If only all youths of the
motherland were like you...

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:09.790
But many have been changed
by this country's poison.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.830
Have you heard about
last week's bombing?

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.130
Yes.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:18.300
The work of radicals. A deplorable act.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:23.240
We value discipline and
honor our pledge to the clan.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.340
Our organization is a family.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:31.340
Every member has dedicated
his skills to that family.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:35.870
And the mark of the one
who holds that clan together...

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:41.390
...is this dragon symbol.

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:45.030
I plan to pass this on to you someday.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:46.930
Grandfather...!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.700
I take it you know about the Kokuren?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:54.600
The group that pledged itself as
our brethren but later split off?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:05:00.910
Yes. However, I've decided to join
with them to stop the radicals.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:08.180
The fastest and most reliable way
is to marry the two clans together.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:11.620
I have recommended you
as our representative.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:16.260
And the man with Kokuren's recommendation

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:19.190
has been invited here today.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:22.300
So that's what today is for.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:25.130
Today is a formal event, of course.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:30.500
It's anyone's guess if you'll be
taken as his partner for life or not!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:36.600
But sympathize with an old man
who cares for his granddaughter.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:43.420
Very well. I'll try my hardest
as your recommendation!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:47.050
You'll do that for me?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.150
He has just arrived.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.540
Grandfather...

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:11.210
For today only, present yourself
as Bailan's representative

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.550
with this symbol upon your chest.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:16.450
This will be our secret!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.290
Thank you for the invitation, Laoban.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:31.200
Let me introduce you.
This is my only grandchild, Sei.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.790
I'm pleased to meet you.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:39.070
My name is Jei. You're just
as beautiful as the rumors say.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.200
I'm glad I could meet you...!

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:50.420
--Sei's embarrassed!
--She sure deals with a lot...

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:53.590
Hey! Who're those guys?!

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:56.320
Look at all those mega hotties!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:02.800
I bet they're empty on the inside
and follow their boss like sheep.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.700
You're so dumb. Looks are
all that count with men!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:09.800
What?! Intelligence is more important!

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:12.110
--Their looks!
--Their interior!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.540
You can't see inside them, so who cares?!

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:20.370
Let's all have a toast to
the beautiful Bailan bride!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:24.170
Look out!

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:37.000
--Are you all right?
--You ruined your suit for me...

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.290
Oh, my...

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:55.880
I wonder what kind of party it is?

00:07:56.850 --> 00:08:01.020
I bet the food is really special too...

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:04.190
I wish I could've gone to see...!

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.710
Want some?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.270
Don't hold back.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:14.700
I'm not really hungry...!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.540
That pipsqueak computer!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:23.940
She never came back from the bathroom!

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:32.820
That sofa looks so comfy!

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.820
Is there nobody in here?

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.660
Aw, they're fake...

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:47.670
I'm tired from eating so much...!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.340
That sure was cool!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.940
If only I could do something like that...

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:58.070
"Look out, Jo! Hiyaa!" or something!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.080
Who's there?!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:09.290
That's the most
expensive vase on the ship!

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.660
What should I do?!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.760
It can't be helped.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:17.760
That which has shape is
ultimately destined to crumble.

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:23.260
--About how much is it?
--Oh, about 100 million yen...

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:30.940
So...

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:35.480
--What is the point of this?
--It's hush money.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:39.140
As long as I keep quiet,
nobody can be blamed!

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:45.060
Amy...!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.230
What're you up to, Meg?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.500
It's not what you--

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.190
Come in, come in.

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.060
I'm so glad you found a nice boyfriend!

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:00.210
Ow!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:04.370
Say any more crap and I won't
hold back just 'cuz you're a kid!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.580
Young girls are so adorable
even when they fight!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:13.450
Understood. So I just
wait for the signal?

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.190
Yeah. I'm all set here.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:17.490
--Who's that?
--You got me.

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.930
--I'll stay with the cute granddaughter
while nobody suspects a thing!
--Something smells fishy...

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.290
Who's there?!

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:29.090
What are you doing here?!

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:33.640
--I can't find the bathroom!
--Bathroom?!

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.740
I can't hold it in!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:38.910
It's that way! Get going!

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:41.810
That doesn't help me! Take me there!

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:43.810
It's at the stern!

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:47.850
--Carry me...!
--Come on...

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:51.260
--It's too late!
--Just hold it in!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.830
Fine! Hurry!

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:55.920
Thanks, Mister!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.770
She's a natural-born devil.

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:03.570
--But wasn't that old man
Laoban's bodyguard?
--Hurry up!

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:05.160
--But wasn't that old man
Laoban's bodyguard?
--Alright, alright!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:10.900
Signals and being ready...
What could they be up to?

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:32.430
Totally cool!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.900
Sei-<i>san</i>...

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:41.110
If you're not against it,
I wouldn't mind if you agree

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:44.140
to the plan my father and Laoban have.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.450
That would make our young
generation the leading role.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:53.080
I plan to break out of this hard,
old shell and start everything anew!

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:58.520
You're quite assertive, aren't you?

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:03.160
It's my opinion that we came
to be a truly large organization

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.630
only because of what we
have accumulated over time.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:12.140
I feel that we cannot grow
without embracing our tradition.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.470
I see...

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:18.580
You seem to be hitting it
off well. That's wonderful.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:22.920
Laoban. Sei-<i>san</i> is as wise
as she is beautiful.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:26.390
Oh, really?! But she's
still inexperienced.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.860
Please give her your guidance!

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:34.630
--Incidentally, I do have a request.
--What might it be?

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:39.600
The symbols from when the
Bailan and Kokuren were one...

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:48.470
I'd like to see Kokuren's symbol
and Bailan's symbol side by side.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:54.110
I beg you, so that I may realize
the responsibility they've carried

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:59.110
as they've been passed down
from one generation to the next.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:06.030
The dragon symbol is a mark of
pedigree bestowed by the emperor.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:12.000
We swear absolute loyalty
to whoever possesses it.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:16.900
Because of this, public use
of it is strictly forbidden.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.740
Please forgive me...

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.910
I suppose it can't be helped.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:25.000
Let's move to the next
bit of entertainment.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.780
--What is this?!
--Grandfather!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.360
What is the meaning of this, Jei?!

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.130
This is the entertainment.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:54.110
What are you scheming?!

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:58.140
--Your era is over.
--What?!

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:01.080
See! They weren't nice guys after all!

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.480
Reality sure is severe!

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.490
--Alright!
--Meg!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:10.720
Listening to superiors,
obeying traditions...

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.460
You guys don't fit the times!

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.130
But I can make the
organization even bigger!

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:19.300
Now where is the dragon symbol?!

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.130
Get away from Grandfather!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:25.240
It seems your granddaughter
doesn't understand the situation.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:29.180
But if she wants to die
with you for some stone...

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.180
...then I'll let her!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.950
How dare you do this...!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:35.470
<i>Grandfather...!</i>

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.950
What a pathetic ploy...!

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:50.220
Hand over the pendant!

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:55.830
--Who're you?!
--Take this...!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.470
I surrender!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.440
Sei! Protect the symbol!

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:04.970
Don't let her off the ship!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:10.770
--Corner her up top!
--Let go of me! Ow!

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:17.060
Leave guards outside the door
and come with me!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.180
Yes, sir!

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:24.260
Hold on, Stephanie! I'm coming!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.390
--No! They're behind you!
--John! Look out!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.010
Talk about dumb!

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:35.410
Hold on, Meg!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.480
Such senseless violence...!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:40.810
--Let's see...
--What are you doing?

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.910
Observing her energy flow.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:48.350
--That sounds unscientific!
--It's nothing to take lightly.

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:50.920
"Illness begins with energy,"
as they say.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:55.730
Her hunger is so strong that
her energy flow is stopped up.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:58.200
You got that part right!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.390
But if she can use
this power correctly...!

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:26.860
Stay inside!

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:28.490
You again?!

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.470
Freeze!

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:45.410
No way!

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:48.480
Even more power than I had predicted!

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.250
What did you do?!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.090
Do you have
personality-reconstruction chips?!

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:55.690
All I did was open her
battle energy pathway

00:16:55.690 --> 00:17:00.090
and flow her tremendous hunger into it.

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:02.760
Wow! Who are you, mister?

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:07.500
Good question.
I <i>was</i> in movies long ago...

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.270
"This movie was based on a true story..."

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:13.930
"This movie was based on a true story..."
That's all?!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.110
--Hello? Jo?
--What is it, Amy?

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:24.080
--Things are bad! Come quick!
--What's wrong?

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:27.890
An empty-headed hunk
tricked Sei and hit Meg!

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:32.320
And then a weird old man turned Meg
into a tiger gone berserk!

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:36.860
Amy, I'm dumb.
Explain so I can understand.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.170
Basically, Sei's in trouble!

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:43.400
Come right away! It's the
dragon-headed ship in the harbor!

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:47.010
What was that about an empty head...?

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:51.580
--Is that scooter out front yours?
--Yeah.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:53.270
Give me the keys.

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.840
It's not paid off yet, okay?!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.720
Well? Are you satisfied?!

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:09.030
Or do you want to feel
even more miserable?!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:13.600
Yes. That's it.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:18.990
Good girl.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.340
I've had enough of your insults!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.890
So <i>this</i> is the dragon symbol?

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:36.380
Now the organization is mine!

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:51.570
Meg...?

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.510
You're the only one left now!

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:56.600
Even if you escape, we'll
follow you wherever you go!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:59.410
What do you plan to do with me?

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:03.080
I'll resolve myself and
wait for the elders to vote.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.920
If you're truly needed in
the eyes of the organization,

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.620
then you can survive.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:12.290
Again with the organization? I pity you.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:16.300
You're supposed to make
your own decisions in life.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:21.560
Living your life tied to
obligations isn't truly living!

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.130
I have no intention to end it here...

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:30.210
I'll be taking the symbol now!

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:49.960
Wow! What is this?!

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.060
It's Jo!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.500
Jo!

00:19:56.570 --> 00:20:00.900
Jo! He's a bad guy! He hit Meg!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:19.890
I did it! I beat fate!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.780
You did it, Jo!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:59.060
That was so incredible!
Jo was super strong too!

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.230
Wish I could've seen!

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:04.500
But I don't remember anything at all...

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:08.670
Kyohei. Sei will pay for the scooter.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.280
Good for you!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:14.840
Yeah! But is Sei-<i>san</i> not coming today?

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:26.890
<i>We value discipline and
honor our pledge to the clan.</i>

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.490
<i>Our organization is a family.</i>

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:33.600
<i>You're supposed to make
your own decisions in life.</i>

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:38.630
I will not run from my own destiny...!

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:04.870
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:12.520
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:12.520 --> 00:22:20.220
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:29.600
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:36.140
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:45.150
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:52.180
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:17.280
<i>Amy is invited into an electronic
labyrinth teeming with desires.</i>

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:21.750
<i>What awaits her in this
mysterious and unknown world?</i>

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:26.690
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Uncharted Cyberspace"
